@startuml
title Task 6 - Автообновление индекса

actor "Scheduler (cron)" as Cron
folder "Источник данных\nknowledge_base/" as Source
rectangle "update_index.py" as Updater
database "Chunk Store\ntask 3/artifacts/chunks.jsonl" as Chunks
database "Vector Index\ntask 3/artifacts/faiss.index" as Index
folder "Logs\ntask 6/logs/" as Logs
folder "State\ntask 6/state/source_state.json" as State

Cron --> Updater : daily 06:00
Source --> Updater : scan new/changed/deleted docs
State --> Updater : previous snapshot
Updater --> Chunks : write chunks + metadata
Updater --> Index : rebuild/update embeddings + FAISS
Updater --> State : save new snapshot
Updater --> Logs : text + json logs

@enduml
